# Build context is this repo's root (see giftlist-devenv/docker-compose.yml, which sets
# `context: ../giftlist-gateway`). Since the GL-25 split the context is one repo rather than the
# whole monorepo, so this list is only about build output and local noise — there is no longer a
# sibling service inside the context to keep out.
# ARCHITECTURE.md "Making the local feed visible to containers".
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
.env
